{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And its blood he shall pour out at the base of the altar of burnt offering</b> — it is the one previously mentioned. But it is the way of Scripture to mention the definite noun in place of the earlier specification, and likewise, \"And he shall lay his hand upon the head of the bull and slaughter the bull\" (Leviticus 4:4). And for our Sages there are midrashim concerning them, for the Torah of YHWH is perfect; there is in it neither deficient nor superfluous."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:50:09.995416604Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}